WEBVTT

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:37.880
Good morning!

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:38.970
So...

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:40.710
how are you feeling?

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:42.300
Manager!

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.240
-Have a seat.
-Would you like an apple?

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:46.480
-How about some music?
-Would you like a tangerine?

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:52.320
I'm here to take care of you two.

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:54.320
Let me know if you need anything.

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.300
Oh, I couldn't possibly...

00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:58.450
That's right.

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:00.200
How about some laundry?

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.270
Let him do his own.

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:06.240
That's right. He can do his.

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:09.140
But I'm here to help-

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:10.700
Please, Ms. Otonashi.

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:15.450
Just seeing you smile...
That's more than I can ask.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.640
Hey! Get your hands off her!

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:22.020
You two sound well.
Why be hospitalized?

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:24.150
-Mrs. Ichinose.
-Mrs. Ichinose.

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:27.020
I thought the manager
could use some help.

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:29.920
Now then, if you have laundry,
give it to me.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.750
-Well, if you insist...
-Well, if you insist...

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:34.730
I knew it! You do have laundry.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.190
Why didn't you just say so?!

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:39.460
Ms. Otonashi, don't worry.

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.630
That's right.
The laundry could be done...

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:43.640
The laundry could be done...?

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:45.000
By whom?

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:46.370
Say it!

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:49.310
By the washing machine.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.680
And? Who operates
the washing machine?

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:56.320
Electricity.

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:58.350
What?

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:00.780
Let's go, Mrs. Ichinose.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:02.040
All right.

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:06.350
Gee, that's the thanks I get.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.460
You're a lucky woman.

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:35.180
What?

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.260
They're both so pitiful.

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:41.760
One breaks his leg trying to save you.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:44.330
The other comes chasing after you.

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:55.240
You can't keep
running away, you know.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:00.440
I-I'm not.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:08.660
What am I running away from?

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:44.120
Godai! Would you mind
turning that down?!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.360
Is it too loud?

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:49.060
Ms. Otonashi, I was talking to Godai.

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:53.230
Godai, I'm going to
turn this down a bit, okay?

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:53.930
Sure.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:08.080
What was that?

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:10.350
They seem awfully intimate.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.390
Has something happened between
those two?

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:18.490
Godai, it's time for your x-ray.

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:19.190
Okay.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.930
I'll accompany him.

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:22.730
I'll go.

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:23.970
Well...

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:27.790
Unless you really
want to be with Godai.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.510
N-No...

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:32.210
It's not that.

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:44.090
-Manager.
-Yes?

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:46.850
Don't let him do
anything to you.

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:47.950
Hey!

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:58.900
Just go!

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:05.340
People just don't trust me, do they?

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:09.170
I did come here because
I knew you'd be here, but...

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:10.370
Please.

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:13.180
But I guess maybe it's no use.

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:19.960
Funny, isn't it? You can laugh at me.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:21.650
I wouldn't.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:24.560
I...

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:26.980
I'm sorry...

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:29.260
Coach Mitaka, I...

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:48.310
Paging Dr. Haida...

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:49.370
Please...

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.490
Please let me go. Soichiro is...

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:55.590
Please come to the nurses' station.

00:06:57.670 --> 00:07:00.290
Forgive me, Ms. Otonashi.

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:28.350
Shall we get going, Soichiro?

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:41.930
You scared me.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.930
Kentaro! You scared me!

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:48.870
I never thought
you'd scream that loud.

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:51.070
Anyway, whatcha doing?

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:57.250
Well...

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:59.250
What?

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:00.850
Just doing a little thinking.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.320
Let's go home, Kentaro.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.260
Okay.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:41.320
Shall I go buy something?

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.730
Ms. Otonashi, why don't you rest?

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:44.900
You should.

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:46.940
I'd rather be moving.

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.030
How about a newspaper or something?

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:51.940
Would you get me a sports paper
and a comic book?

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.070
Thank you.

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:54.640
No need to thank me.

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:55.950
What about you, Coach Mitaka?

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:57.480
Well, if you don't mind...

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:00.640
I'd like the Economic Times
and Newsweek, please.

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:03.580
Sure.

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:05.980
Why don't I
get some juice, too.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.360
-Thank you!
-Thank you!

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.790
I love having things to do.

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:14.730
It's been a while since
I had someone to care for.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.040
Coach Mitaka!

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:19.500
We're here to see you!

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.300
G-Girls...!

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:26.780
We didn't know you
were hospitalized.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:29.250
We found out when we went
to practice.

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:31.140
How sad to see you like this!

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:35.620
Ms. Otonashi, these are
some college girls I teach...

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:37.650
Mitaka, I see you're not
just popular with old ladies...

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:39.990
but with young girls, too.

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:41.780
I wouldn't say that..

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:43.680
Don't so modest!

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.530
There's a three-month waiting list
to have a date with you.

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:48.230
Uh-huh!

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:52.930
We decided that we'll take turns
caring for you every day, Coach.

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:55.670
Really, it's not...

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:58.300
You should just
accept their offer gratefully.

00:09:58.480 --> 00:09:59.940
Back off, Godai.

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.250
It's hard for one person to care
for two people, after all.

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:05.440
Uh... Well...

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:07.310
Ms. Otonashi.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.120
Godai!

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:16.760
I'm sorry I haven't been able to come.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:20.120
Manager, thank you so much.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:24.900
I'll care for him from today.

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:25.830
Oh...

00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:27.470
Kozue...

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.630
Just accept her offer gratefully.

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:31.100
Hey!

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:32.730
He's right...

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.970
I'll be going now.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.990
I shouldn't have worried.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:27.260
FOOL

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:34.200
Maybe I'll go visit Soichiro's grave.

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:05.110
The manager's not coming?

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:08.610
She said there's no need
for all of us to be here.

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:14.990
So you two are finally going home!

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:16.450
Thank you for everything, Doctor.

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:17.820
Thank you.

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:21.510
Sure. I'm glad to see
that you're both going home.

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:25.920
Don't ever come back.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:28.530
Take care.

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:29.630
I will.

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:30.570
Thank you.

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:34.300
Did you make trouble?

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:37.780
Actually, it's your fault
and everyone else's.

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:47.780
We're going to have a welcome home
party at Coach Mitaka's.

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:49.760
Would you like to join us?

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:51.250
What do you say, Godai?

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.120
No thank you.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.160
It's already late.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.690
Take care, Coach Mitaka.

00:12:58.570 --> 00:12:59.190
See ya.

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:00.560
Take care.

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:02.660
See you again!
Bye, Godai!

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.270
Bye.

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:18.080
There. That's it.

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:19.510
Oops.  I forgot.

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:32.390
Maybe I should have gone
to pick him up, too.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:37.460
Hey, Soichiro!
Stop!

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:45.430
Watch your head, now.

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:46.500
I'm fine!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.240
Ow!

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:56.650
I'm back.

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:58.520
Welcome home.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:03.560
Hello!

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:04.680
Kozue!

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:06.860
I decided to come with him.

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:10.000
I figured he'd need help
when he got home.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:17.000
Oh, that's true. I'm so glad
that you could come.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.810
I'm too busy to help him.

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:22.270
Take good care of him.

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:25.610
Leave him to me.
Let's go, Godai.

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:46.070
Don't be shy!

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:49.140
I'm fine.  Really.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:53.440
No... Hey, don't do that, Godai.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:58.040
I wonder what they're doing?

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:01.750
It's none of my business.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.750
What's the matter with me?

00:15:09.730 --> 00:15:11.660
Welcome back!!

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:15.320
Let's party it up!
It's on Godai tonight!

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:17.220
Again?

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.800
I don't have any money!

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:20.470
I just got out of the hospital!

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:24.170
Don't worry. Don't worry.

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:27.810
Leave everything to me tonight!

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:29.980
You can pay me back later.

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:31.080
All right!

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:32.410
It's NOT all right!

00:15:35.190 --> 00:15:36.910
Manager?

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.950
Come here and join us.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:42.620
No, no.
She can't...

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.350
Why not?

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:46.960
She misses her dead husband.

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:49.090
Seems she suddenly remembered him.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.830
Really? Why now?

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:54.570
She doesn't want any other man.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:55.530
No...

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.940
Dead men don't betray you.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.240
H-Hey!

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:02.780
Cheers!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.280
Cheers!

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:10.110
I got one!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:13.990
Cold winter night
Animals and critters
Go into hiding

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:15.520
What's that?

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:41.790
I knew that someday...

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:47.050
the manager would pull herself out
of her deep sorrow.

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.670
Godai's going back
to the hospital for a check-up.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.040
Why don't you go with him?
It'll make him happy.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.560
I'm a manager.

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.530
I have work to do around here.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:24.760
Godai is not my only tenant.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:39.800
-Uh...
-Bye.

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:42.710
S-See you later.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:54.190
Oops.

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:03.950
Hey!

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:06.890
Mitaka.

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.510
You're here, too?

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:09.340
Uh-huh.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.410
Well, see you.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:13.410
Bye.

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:42.070
I see.

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:46.550
So Ms. Otonashi's been ignoring you
since you went home.

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:49.910
Order whatever you want.
It's on me!

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:54.410
But that Ms. Otonashi.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:59.580
How long does it usually
take her to get over it?

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:02.190
You didn't make up with her?

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:04.590
Did I say that?

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:10.460
I see... I should've known.

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:14.030
It's never
that easy to make up.

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:18.310
-She's so stubborn.
-She's so stubborn.

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:37.190
I can't believe what I'm seeing.

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:47.460
R-Really?

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:50.730
Am I right?
Don't you think that's weird?

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:52.430
You're right.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:54.630
No wonder he's so late.

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:57.070
Oh heavens! Look at the time!

00:19:57.390 --> 00:20:01.650
You know, I-I've
never even kissed Kozue!

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:04.580
I rarely hold her hand.

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:10.660
B-But the manager has
no idea whatsoever how I feel!

00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:13.660
I only dated those girls.

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:15.030
I've never done anything with them.

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:16.760
This makes no sense.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:20.930
You've been playing around with tens or
hundreds or thousands of girls.

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:25.540
That makes you a hundred or a thousand
times more unattractive to Kyoko!

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:27.310
What're you talking about?!

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:32.040
That's...up to her.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:34.280
Yeah.

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:39.990
Kyoko only sees
what she wants to see.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:58.500
Coach Mitaka's not home yet, either.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.940
Who cares about Soichiro!

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:10.310
She should make up her mind!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:15.920
I-I care about her
and she keeps ignoring! me!

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:19.730
It's time we tell her
exactly how we feel!

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:22.660
That's right.  We gotta tell her.

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:23.730
Godai!

00:21:24.570 --> 00:21:27.730
I can't have her make
a fool of me anymore!

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.840
Okay.  All right!!

00:21:43.390 --> 00:21:46.680
The final train for
the evening will be departing.

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:49.960
This is the final train.

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:06.310
Damn you, Soichiro!

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:08.100
That's right!

00:22:08.420 --> 00:22:09.710
Damn you, too, Kyoko!

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:12.550
Say it again!  Louder!

00:22:13.020 --> 00:22:15.680
DAMN YOU, KYOKO!!!

00:22:15.760 --> 00:22:17.920
THAT'S RIGHT! DAMN YOU!!!

00:22:18.790 --> 00:22:20.750
Please leave now.

00:22:20.830 --> 00:22:22.260
We're sorry.

00:22:24.700 --> 00:22:26.490
Mitaka, lend me a crutch.

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:28.060
Why?

00:22:28.470 --> 00:22:30.490
I forgot mine on the train.

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:32.330
You did? Way to go!

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:35.720
Y'all right?

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:36.640
Yeah.

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:48.350
We better tell her!

00:22:49.690 --> 00:22:51.880
I can't wait to see
the shock on her face!

00:22:51.960 --> 00:22:54.080
That's a promise, all right?

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:55.490
YEAH!

00:22:55.800 --> 00:22:56.660
Oh?

00:23:05.270 --> 00:23:06.460
I'm so glad.

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:09.640
I was so worried.

00:23:10.180 --> 00:23:12.010
Where were you?

00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:14.670
Uh...

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:16.800
W-We're sorry.

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:28.560
-If only he weren't here right now...
-If only he weren't here right now...

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:30.820
Are your legs all right?

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:32.110
-Yes!
-Yes!

00:23:41.010 --> 00:23:43.340
-Damn you!
-Damn you!

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:53.840
A photo album was discovered
in the clock tower attic.

00:23:54.220 --> 00:23:57.180
What do the photos mean?

00:23:57.590 --> 00:24:01.850
Next: "Kentaro Goes Pale!
Yotsuya's Frightening Aspect!"

00:24:02.430 --> 00:24:03.390
Come to think of it...

00:24:03.470 --> 00:24:06.830
we really don't know anything
at all about Mr. Yotsuya.
